WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.400
Standing heavy punch hits Ryu near the corner.

2
00:00:01.400 --> 00:00:02.300
Perfect light Flash Knuckle launches Ryu.

3
00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:03.150
Regular light Flash Knuckle continues the juggle.

4
00:00:03.150 --> 00:00:04.200
Medium Rising Uppercut finishes as Ryu reaches the wall.

5
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:05.200
Ryu finishes the knockdown at the corner.
